# .claude/worktrees holds throwaway git worktrees: full repo copies, each with
# its own node_modules and its own checked-out revision of every file here.
# Formatting them means formatting the same files several times over, against
# whatever revision each worktree happens to sit on — so `npm run format:check`
# reports failures nobody can fix and nothing in CI can see, since worktrees
# are never committed. eslint.config.js and vitest.config.ts already exclude
# this path for the same reason; this was the one gate that did not.
.claude/worktrees
